---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="po — a native, chat-driven AI harness"
  description="Everything in po is driven from the chat: slash commands, the command palette, and the buttons all dispatch into one explicit state machine. Native gpui-ce UI, local-first nano-ai inference, append-only sessions."
>
  <div class="flex min-h-dvh items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8">
    <section
      class="card landing-card w-full max-w-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100/95 shadow-2xl"
      aria-labelledby="site-title"
    >
      <div class="card-body items-center gap-6 p-5 text-center sm:gap-8 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
        <header class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <h1 id="site-title" class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-[0.2em]">po</h1>
          <p class="max-w-prose text-base-content/65">
            A native, chat-driven AI harness. Local-first inference, append-only
            sessions, tool approvals — one state machine under all of it.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            class="btn btn-secondary min-h-12 px-6"
            href="https://github.com/debanjanbasu/po"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            class="btn btn-ghost min-h-12 px-6"
            href="https://github.com/debanjanbasu/po#quick-start"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Quick start
          </a>
        </div>

        <section class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Features">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/60 p-4">
            <h2 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">Chat-driven</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              Slash commands, cmd-k palette, and buttons all dispatch the same
              events into one explicit agent state machine.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/60 p-4">
            <h2 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">Local-first</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              The nano-ai engine runs MiniCPM-V in-process on Apple Silicon;
              echo and OpenAI-compatible endpoints fill in everywhere else.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/60 p-4">
            <h2 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">Replayable</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              Sessions are append-only JSONL logs — switch reloads from disk,
              fork writes a branch, replay is deterministic.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
          MIT OR Apache-2.0 · gpui-ce · nano-ai · IBM 3270
        </footer>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
